    "licenseFile": "assets/tilesets/original/LICENSE.txt",
    "changes": "New integer-grid vector paths and pixel art, exported at 1 unit = 1 pixel. No source-sheet pixels copied. Constellations are illustrative zodiac silhouettes, not sky charts. Speaker-room refinement adds a native large display, lectern, north-facing chairs and slim forge/balance wall reliefs; original social-space assets remain available. Campus addition: original translucent navy 32px atmosphere tile, rendered from campus.svg; imported sheets remain unchanged. Amenities addition: original cosmic arcade cabinet in amenities.svg/amenities.png; existing imported sheets and original artwork unchanged. Guide addition: original blue Lyra, purple Aster and gold Nova transparent robot sprites in guides.svg/guides.png, authored on a native integer grid; no imported pixels copied. Wayfinding addition: original integer-grid navy/wood/brass signboard components, compass and gold cardinal chevrons in wayfinding.svg/wayfinding.png, with no imported pixels copied. Medium-hub addition: original native fixed-camera warm-wall roofed building and deterministic bold block-glyph English nameplate/navigation art, generated from hub-nameplates.json and hub-art.ts into hub-buildings.svg/png and hub-labels.svg/png. No system font or imported pixels used; all existing atlas bytes unchanged. Original coastal sailing vessel, sails, nautical furniture, sand/water/foam, wildlife and sponsor aircraft/balloon frames authored in coastal.svg; reference composition only, no paid image pixels copied. Exterior-road addition: six original upright native masonry/timber gate elevations and compact road/return plaques, generated deterministically by exterior-gates.ts using the original block glyphs. Existing artwork and atlas pixels remain unchanged. Added original native painted FA SHIP block-glyph decals, human-scale cannon and mast base, plus dedicated whole-plane/banner animation atlas. Existing source pixels retained. Roadster: original generated sixteen-pose sheet compiled with uniform nearest-neighbor scale, binary alpha, fixed tech pad and native Tiled animation; source generation/crop receipts retained. Beach refinement: beach-lounge.svg/png and beach-surf.svg/png add integer-grid native pixel palms, striped parasols/recliners, slatted tables, woven towels, timber cabana/bar and gentle 2080ms four-frame surf. A separate translucent original tile calms the existing licensed LPC water; imported source sheets are unchanged. Original standing caption glyph atlas added: semantic source linked to existing original pixel alphabet plus original arrows; no imported pixels.",
